                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The calendar contains records of over 4000 concerts, advertised in London daily newspapers from 1750 to 1800: subscription concerts, benefits, oratorio performances, meetings of musical societies, concerts at the principal gardens. Information on concert programmes is provided where known, with editorial standardization of names, genres and instruments.</p>"
